# Last word, after the allowlist: the golden corpus is a verbatim dump of real
# statements — masked card numbers, credit limits, merchant rows. The same PII
# as samples/*.pdf, so it never leaves this machine either. Regenerate it with
# `python scripts/make_golden.py`.
tests/golden/

